{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "725c50eb455edbe20fe877e7dbc32a67ac48f657f6c073bc82cb65f4242e39ee", "ja": "3人だけで町に出かけたリブラのメンバー。\nだがのり子と美奈子がお土産を買っている間\nに、翼が消えてしまう。一方、律子と美希の\n言葉で3人と一緒にいようと思い直した\nプロデューサーは、3人の元へと向かう。", "zh": "『天秤座』的成员三人独自上街游玩，不过在\n法子跟美奈子买伴手礼时，翼却失踪了。\n另一方面，在律子及美希的提议下，制作人\n改变主意，打算前往三人身边陪伴她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1000_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "91800caf0abe9b5ab30c2957c1e504b411f06e3591ddf3a625c71c69fba0295b", "ja": "はーい、お疲れさまでしたー。\n休憩入りまーす。", "zh": "好──大家辛苦了──\n现在起是休息时间──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ab543acad005c09c81e78a53eb03eb4049edef498113cf003a15e2e23e1f8ce5", "ja": "美希、律子、お疲れさま！\n撮影は順調に進んでるみたいだな。", "zh": "美希、律子，辛苦了！\n拍摄的状况感觉很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "032713417e9d8b8bf7551b2819f30bb24b9aef58f64872c5637f39fd7edebc3e", "ja": "バッチリなの☆　{$P$}、\n撮影が終わったら、ご褒美期待してるね♪", "zh": "完美无缺☆{$P$}，\n美希很期待拍完之后的奖励喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "1c2233164697bd11f1f6bcae9eaf0a0c01a941be300dec3bc26dc88013bfe895", "ja": "まったくこの子ったら。後輩に示しがつかないから、\n甘やかさないでくださいよ、{$P$}？", "zh": "你这孩子真是的。{$P$}，\n可别太宠她了喔，不然其他后辈会学坏的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "6a8f013bc14340b440293a3d7eab5427536de33b923eb651fb9b5ddcc2cba974", "ja": "あれ？　そういえばのり子たちは、\n今日は来てないんですか？", "zh": "咦？说到这里，\n法子她们今天不过来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "73689c1aef0ace69e7185fe09651a477a58b5200bb64c1c1e50faba8f6496bbe", "ja": "ああ、それなんだけどな……。", "zh": "哦，她们啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1006_null", "source_sha256": "d05afe66f3410ee1f068ec6a59db61ac9678368de6193e908f70b1357823db26", "ja": "その頃……。", "zh": "就在此时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "352b75d2e50ae8e02fae8a429a49893db1b0dbdc15d5a6743f7513c2ea1619e6", "ja": "……というわけで、\n今日は{$P$}とは別行動！", "zh": "……事情就是这样，所以我们今天\n要跟{$P$}分头行动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "19ce7e8f77e4130695ab91b79982a06ae5798ba2e6223088b2153ddde29eb262", "ja": "自分たちの行動は、自分たちで決める！\nこれこそ、バカンスの極意だよね♪", "zh": "想做什么都由我们自己决定！\n这才是度假的精髓吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "05662703d3a0aa94cc734c9fdf21b25a2475a12fa9f1bf3d7e99fbd599396377", "ja": "でも、どこに遊びに行こう？\n面白そうなところがいっぱいあって、迷っちゃうね。", "zh": "可是，我们要去哪里玩才好？\n看起来好玩的地方实在太多了，真让人犹豫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2e7bc309f5e4c86fd1c390a5da7e2641ed36d1305a1207016ed40aefd6bf61fc", "ja": "まずは、ウインドウショッピングしませんか？\n昨日、気になるお店たくさん見かけたし！", "zh": "我们先去逛逛街怎么样？\n我昨天看到好多不错的店家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "3c56985048e306495cfa9d41d3c3cb229273627ecfb2e2c9acf5ee4d2c92a225", "ja": "おっ、いいコト言ったね、翼特派員！\nんじゃ、ウィンドウショッピング行くよ～！", "zh": "哦，你说得好，翼特派员！\n那我们去逛逛街吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a8cba52b4d22a18ef3587f81e5f026670f362015e728a0f6f40475cd616e2086", "ja": "やったー♪　じゃあさっそく～……。\nあっ、あそこでココナッツジュース売ってますよ！", "zh": "耶──♪那就赶快出发～\n啊，那边在卖椰子汁耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "79271f3020a1ab2bcc09dcfcdb46b2cdfccbf4b4ad51aa35cf5c782402133fed", "ja": "おおっ、ヤシの実に直接ストロー差してある！\n南国っぽい！", "zh": "哦哦，吸管直接插在椰子上！\n超有南国的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "cf9b322210e375440e44afa4c5e022a972946e9fbe76689860b289ec4495fda8", "ja": "あっちのカラフルなかき氷も気になるし、\n目移りしちゃうなぁ……決められないかも！", "zh": "那个色彩缤纷的刨冰好像也很好吃，\n真让人眼花撩乱……好难下决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3e207cf3da6b89f6eace309ea046cc7b390fde7012804f95195e8d0c12aee4f7", "ja": "食べ物で迷っちゃうなら、お土産を先に見るのは\nどうですか？　ほら、こっち。おもしろそうですよ～！", "zh": "如果不知道要吃什么，干脆先看伴手礼怎么样？\n你们看，就在这边，感觉很好逛喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2b915b8641ef6268edce04bfbf0516c49ecc1787922a26a993f26221388e9710", "ja": "雑貨屋さんだね。化粧品に石鹸、服にアクセサリー……\nわっ！　この木彫りの人形、顔が大きい！？", "zh": "是杂货店呢。有化妆品跟肥皂，还有衣服跟饰品……\n哇！这个木雕人偶，脸也太大了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "90a4f0191b175ff4f61e33aac58e9176422106ecf36690d05fc59eee40cbe5bf", "ja": "ホントだ。なんか、レスラーのマスクみたいだけど……\nあっ、これ神様なんだって。お守りみたいなものかな？", "zh": "真的耶，总觉得好像摔角选手的面具……\n啊，上面写这是神明耶，会不会是类似护身符的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "2c4b1435d1486d4caf22ad47dee0440b7c1224dc12d0e7c36e911157535e50eb", "ja": "そうみたい。厄除けに健康運、金運にご長寿……\nいろいろあって、なんだかおもしろいね。", "zh": "好像是这样没错，有消灾解厄跟健康运，\n还有财运跟长命百岁……种类很多，真有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a97c53f97934c85a2a3ffddb9097bef6f3b5db780b296cd84650f28a47716aa3", "ja": "うん、ちょっとカワイイかも♪\n……あ～！　ねえねえ、あの看板！", "zh": "嗯，有点可爱呢♪\n……啊～！你们快看，那个看板！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "6826e2f5901f46c18ed06e7773389d214dd53a273be083c3a86f1d01123dbbab", "ja": "どうしたの、翼ちゃん？\nえっと、『熱帯魚と泳ぐダイビングツアー』……？", "zh": "怎么了，小翼？\n我看看，『与热带鱼同游潜水之旅』……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3bba813e693be116f88a42c9ebd0d80e169fa01fc68ad18deb87c8c426d903c4", "ja": "わたし、あれやってみたいかも……！\nすっごく、バカンス～ってカンジしますよね？", "zh": "我有点想试试那个……！\n让人很有度假～的感觉对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "d365d0bb48de75a828f8721a21d03be331e7226119c2a3b1e95f3a3a955aa32b", "ja": "ダイビングいいね、面白そう！\n美奈子、せっかくだからみんなでやろうよ！", "zh": "潜水不错耶，感觉很好玩！\n美奈子，难得来一趟，大家一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "c3daf508568cf9a781f650b077ceb76036180582b65f79ab1e28932114dd8c0a", "ja": "待って、2人とも……値段が書いてある。\n一人あたり、90分2万円だって。", "zh": "你们等一下……上面有写价钱。\n每个人90分钟要2万日圆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "a5d89e5cf95784fe0028414a5adffa1f8e58f3536994a6e60cbb93ed3edd542f", "ja": "ええっ！？　{$P$}にもらった予算が\n一人1万円くらいだから……全然足りないじゃん！", "zh": "什么！？{$P$}给我们的预算是\n一人1万日圆……根本不够啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "92d07345ae3ad761b0607a65a02caaede9fd342fb010cb6fcfc0730a9692be2d", "ja": "えーっ！？　楽しそうなのにぃ……。\nそれなら、予算に自分のお小遣いを足すのはダメ？", "zh": "欸──！？可是真的感觉很好玩……\n那不够的部分，可不可以用自己的零用钱垫上呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "4d0f1f509db1a50834aff5eb0c05336cfdabc6d037b08b3e141fe0873dcb3a7d", "ja": "うーん……ギリギリ足りるかもしれないけど、\n他のことが何もできなくなっちゃいそうだよ。", "zh": "唔……可能勉强够用，\n但是就没有剩下的钱可以做别的事了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c1c61935c236a1a90c1f27f19f209204e08d8d146fd827a98e909358e709eb3", "ja": "そっか、そうだよね。劇場のみんなにお土産も買って\nいきたいし、ここで予算を使い切るのはなあ……。", "zh": "对耶，说得也是，我还想买一些伴手礼带回去给\n剧场的大家，也不能现在就把预算全用掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0f3e9a14fe2e288fc8e3f673d725fea225d941cacf4972f2c05afd3349b320e", "ja": "そっかー。\nじゃあ、あきらめないとですね……。", "zh": "这样啊──\n那也只有放弃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "39c1dc98e3ca4fa817fea3dcba320312b22a38b4b7c9a524e05b48e7204f7155", "ja": "ごめんね、翼ちゃん。\nもう少し安かったらよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "抱歉啊，小翼。\n如果价格再便宜一些就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "6c4d2bfe125d0629ff908f8c5edba5e369bec530446b9a5bef884f39cf70284f", "ja": "ねえ、先にお土産を買ってから遊ぼうか？\nそのほうが、いくらまで使えるか計算しやすいし。", "zh": "欸，我们要不要先买好伴手礼再去玩？\n这样也比较好算之后还有多少钱可以用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "db3cbd8fad3a8c90a724b60a5f8db600205a87a4af09ec63b0eb1439c79a891e", "ja": "あっ、そうですね。\n美奈子さん、頭いい♪", "zh": "啊，有道理。\n美奈子真聪明♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "1a9a67373f7f81e70f949cc5f1794dff932b6b84640d48bb83e6202282a1a872", "ja": "おっ、さっそくお土産屋さんをはっけーん！\n翼、ほら、行こ行こっ！", "zh": "哦，马上就发现一家礼品店了！\n翼，来，走吧走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "f2a3e1b8002e98ddc029143a346b0cb4957f3c5b0ffad454d8e6e794dfa936e0", "ja": "いやー、大漁大漁。\nなかなかいい買い物出来たんじゃない？", "zh": "哎呀──大丰收大丰收。\n我们挑的礼物都很棒耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "ea23a9912b626a5b2392a9183a7be9720f9f310f01d7b4e25d9e0ade9b63bf4b", "ja": "うん、このマカダミアナッツのチョコレート、\n奈緒ちゃんきっと好きだと思うなぁ。", "zh": "嗯，这个夏威夷果巧克力，\n小绪一定会喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "9980251183cc6ce158226b363dcb356b5038926aba6e7af563d86160b6336546", "ja": "桃子と育と環には、おそろいの小銭入れ……\n色違いで、かわいいよね♪", "zh": "桃子、育跟环的礼物，是同款的零钱包……\n只有颜色不同，很可爱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "e6d9e8aa1c84e59a454615ffa5f951bdf0b78dae2f33161d81797fa7fa04b0d4", "ja": "翼ちゃんは、未来ちゃんと静香ちゃんに何を買ったの？\n……あれ？", "zh": "小翼帮未来还有静香买了什么呢？\n……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "e9e89336b466f79c9174e77f6dfff325771a505e3c52faada51dc0ff3bea2dfd", "ja": "翼ちゃん、どこー？　……おかしいなあ、\n一緒にお店に入ったはずなのに。", "zh": "小翼，你在哪──？\n……真奇怪，她刚刚应该是跟我们一起进店里的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "1423652c78889081b53f5fd1a5dc3b651648a71740fa99b23ed320c1106e3a41", "ja": "おーい、翼ー！　つばさー！\n……お店の中には、いないみたい……？", "zh": "喂──翼──！翼──！\n……她好像没有在店里耶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "2a47f414fe35837fc9133f290891f543d510778dae71214beee1df97dc08717c", "ja": "ねえ、のり子ちゃん。\nこれって、もしかして……。", "zh": "那个，小法。\n看现在这个状况，难不成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "3f5c6992ed0f4298b5d2603e6b66f7e8b5629c41bdabf59f73768ac15e7bddf6", "ja": "う、うん……\n翼、迷子になっちゃったかも……！？", "zh": "啊、嗯……\n翼，说不定是迷路了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1042_null", "source_sha256": "d05afe66f3410ee1f068ec6a59db61ac9678368de6193e908f70b1357823db26", "ja": "その頃……。", "zh": "就在此时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "a235e3b70a4628784fd2322fdcc85c8d70f284f98b9427548fc5dff360e4c6b0", "ja": "{$P$}、本当によかったんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "4ee29d5d12243585bc2bf491bf4114836d1a6ba0a40d2542b33eebf06677c4f3", "ja": "何がだ？", "zh": "什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "b39f7d7a0600a8bf22dd8dce606d24816cbac9ea875a491e1d4a3444532985b8", "ja": "引率のために一緒に来たんでしょう？\nのり子たちについてたほうが、いいと思いますよ。", "zh": "你应该是为了带队才一起来的吧？\n我觉得你跟着法子她们一起行动比较好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e6d72c1d413e0aa243ff0bc55d4c873e22cbe9ab20259361530a8e6da6b39d4c", "ja": "もちろん心配だけど、過保護なのもいけないかなって。\nバカンスは、自由気ままじゃないと。", "zh": "担心自然是担心，但我觉得过度保护也不好。\n毕竟度假还是要自由自在的才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ef5b03e05196f28e0149e17dcf31f9a887ca9415a06174ff36813188a584fa5d", "ja": "それにのり子も美奈子も、子どもじゃない。\n心配してないんじゃなくて、信頼してるんだよ。", "zh": "况且法子跟美奈子都不是小孩了。\n我并非不担心，而是信任她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1048_009rit", "source_sha256": "fb7bfa0abe3adb7c34796dd8ea99f93d8c39bb4b34137b49ea21e46127b04882", "ja": "アイドルに自立を促すっていう考えには、\n基本的には同意なんですけど……。", "zh": "我基本上也赞同培养偶像独立自主的概念，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1049_003mik", "source_sha256": "e9a7b35f5f97ef290b29f8c2dbc00d8f87aaea6dc29e8318169b2a70f489fcef", "ja": "今日はミキも、律子、さんに賛成かも、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "今天美希也觉得律子……姊说得挺有道理的，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "53200b6008a02ea9d7b4a195d2b3ccae850f4b3e5f2b6b85fb55159fe9836b29", "ja": "美希？", "zh": "美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "cb8b3eee7f7ce99abbd911a787ffecf2fe71b19965dfce8865451c30b275131e", "ja": "ミキ、今日の撮影は絶好調だったよ。それって、\n{$P$}が見てたからだと思うな。", "zh": "美希今天的拍摄状态非常好喔。美希觉得，这是因为有\n{$P$}在旁边看着的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1052_003mik", "source_sha256": "00d94da9eaa4fb12662c211788e92d0ee2033a4df4a99599d0ecda518777ddbb", "ja": "のり子たちのバカンスにも、{$P$}が\n一緒にいたほうが、絶対楽しいの☆", "zh": "若法子她们的假期也有{$P$}的陪伴，\n她们一定会玩得更开心的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1053_p", "source_sha256": "a0e8a490bcc5d91bbb3ab532f4000b179b1393592c17bcfa509ed02e6effe512", "ja": "そ、そうか。バカンスに俺がずっとついてたら、\n窮屈なんじゃないかと思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我之前想说，度假时要是\n我还一直跟在旁边，她们会不会觉得很闷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1054_009rit", "source_sha256": "5e69e7af43500d478c9c5702fbfac063d026ef55b5eeb7d5ee8d1781df6133cb", "ja": "あら？　{$P$}が一緒じゃ、\n羽を伸ばせないような子たちだと思いますか？", "zh": "哦？{$P$}觉得她们是那种\n有你跟在旁边就无法自在放松的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "b6db25e3a745263726f22516334c9327fb221492e236fbeaf340a9fb0535d7f6", "ja": "ははっ……たしかに、そうだったな。\nありがとう。じゃ、3人のところへ行ってくるよ。", "zh": "哈哈……你说的确实很有道理。\n谢谢，那我就先去她们三个那里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1056_003mik", "source_sha256": "30d6d7244be39954821e753b5c64a9984b4adc1903a348f2eab40aa67826af4c", "ja": "いってらっしゃいなの☆", "zh": "请慢走☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_04_1057_009rit", "source_sha256": "1d26ec35522b466b8d656bd3f283f475fdd161656ded1f82a84902268e6b55be", "ja": "私と美希は、撮影が終わったらヴィラに戻ってます。\n帰ったら、連絡してくださいね！", "zh": "我跟美希拍摄结束后会回度假别墅，\n你们回来时记得联络我喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
